# Hand the descent to ArduPilot's LAND, detect touchdown (FCU disarm, or
# altitude still after a real descent) and, if `disarm`, stop the props.
# The rules only count a landing "com helices desligadas".
bool disarm
---
bool success             # touched down
bool props_stopped       # disarm confirmed by /mavros/state
float32 z                # resting altitude = the surface's top
string message
---
string phase             # descending | disarming
